### Todo Service API Tests

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@todoId = 

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Create Todo - Simple
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Go",
  "description": "Build microservices with Go"
}

### 2. Create Todo - Without Description
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Setup Kafka"
}

### 3. Create Todo - Complex Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Implement Authentication",
  "description": "Add JWT authentication to the microservices"
}

### 4. Get All Todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos

### 5. Get Todo by ID
# Replace with actual MongoDB ObjectId from create response
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{todoId}}

### 6. Get Todo by ID - Example with ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

### 7. Update Todo - Full Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Ktor Advanced",
  "description": "Master coroutines, channels, and actors in Ktor"
}

### 8. Update Todo - Title Only
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Setup Kafka Cluster"
}

### 9. Update Todo - Description Only
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Configure 3-node Kafka cluster with Zookeeper"
}

### 10. Mark Todo as Completed
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{todoId}}/complete

### 11. Delete Todo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{todoId}}

### Error Cases

### 12. Create Todo - Empty Title (Error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "This should fail"
}

### 13. Get Todo - Invalid ID Format (Error)
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/invalid-id

### 14. Get Todo - Non-existent ID (Error)
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/507f1f77bcf86cd799439099

### 15. Update Todo - Non-existent ID (Error)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todos/507f1f77bcf86cd799439099
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "This won't work"
}

### 16. Complete Todo - Non-existent ID (Error)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todos/507f1f77bcf86cd799439099/complete

### 17. Delete Todo - Non-existent ID (Error)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/507f1f77bcf86cd799439099

### Workflow Example

### Step 1: Create a new todo
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Deploy to Production",
  "description": "Deploy todo-service to production environment"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("createdTodoId", response.body.id);
    client.log("Created Todo ID: " + response.body.id);
%}

### Step 2: Get the created todo
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{createdTodoId}}

### Step 3: Update the todo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{createdTodoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Deploy to Production - Updated",
  "description": "Deploy todo-service to production with monitoring enabled"
}

### Step 4: Mark as completed
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{createdTodoId}}/complete

### Step 5: Verify completion
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{createdTodoId}}

### Step 6: Delete the todo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{createdTodoId}}

### Step 7: Verify deletion (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{createdTodoId}}
